{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2023-05-23 13:15:00', 'title': 'COMERICA BANK RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF THE 50 MOST COMMUNITY-MINDED COMPANIES IN THE UNITED STATES FOR EIGHTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': "DALLAS , MAY 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COMERICA BANK HAS BEEN NAMED A 2023 HONOREE OF THE CIVIC 50 BY POINTS OF LIGHT, THE WORLD'S LARGEST ORGANIZATION DEDICATED TO VOLUNTEER SERVICE, IN RECOGNITION OF ITS SUPPORT FOR LOCAL COMMUNITIES. THIS MARKS THE EIGHTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR AND NINTH TIME OVERALL THAT COMERICA HAS EARNED THE HONOR SINCE THE AWARD'S INCEPTION IN 2012, MAKING COMERICA ONE OF ONLY A SMALL GROUP OF COMPANIES THAT HAVE CONSISTENTLY ACHIEVED SUCH HIGH MARKS THROUGHOUT THE PROGRAM'S 11-YEAR HISTORY."}